Method: section 2.2 of https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.01005

Adaptation: internal/compute/cuda_v41_shared_attention.cu
(k_v41_shared_attention_combine). The two-state prefix/suffix merge is
generalized to N split-KV partials per head, rewritten to base-2 LSEs with
explicitly rounded products and sums, and extended with a V4.1 attention sink
folded after the merge as out *= 1/(1+exp2(sink*log2(e) - lse)), matching the
fak host reference v41SparseMLADecodeReference. FP8 output, packed vector
loads and the torch dispatch layer are not carried.
